 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "activities is a list of [time, orderId, event] rows for one dasher and one day, in non-decreasing time order; time is \"HH:MM\" (00:00 to 23:59). Each order is accepted exactly once and later finished exactly once by \"delivered\"; every accepted order is finished within the list. An order is ongoing during the minutes m with accept minute <= m < finish minute. Every minute pays 30 cents for each ongoing order (base rate times the number of concurrent deliveries). Return the total pay in integer cents.",
